{'symbol': 'UNP', 'date': '2022-09-12 11:00:00', 'title': 'UNION PACIFIC ISSUES $600 MILLION IN GREEN BONDS TO FUND INVESTMENTS AIMED AT REDUCING CARBON FOOTPRINT', 'text': "OMAHA, NEB. , SEPT. 12, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- UNION PACIFIC CORPORATION (NYSE: UNP) ISSUED A $600 MILLION GREEN BOND OFFERING TO FUND INVESTMENTS AIMED AT DECARBONIZING THE COMPANY'S FOOTPRINT AND ACHIEVING SET EMISSIONS REDUCTION TARGETS."}